  "details": "Ever since the menus changed from previously opaque to being transparent, they are so laggy they are sometimes impossible to use (well, that's the case for the Vive Focus in general, but the transparent menus aren't doing it any favors. It did use to be faster before the update that changed the UI and gave us the new quick menu).\nI wonder why the Android version(s) of VRC have gone out of their way to make e.g. the expression menu, and portals opaque, but the quick and main menu's are now transparent.",
